  buttonFill: {fileID: 1550879570}
  tutorialText: {fileID: 306219406}
  buttonText: {fileID: 554142987}
  tutorialLines:
  - It is unknown when the last phase of ice was introduced to Earth.
  - It is known the ice assimilated all water, freezing all life. Even oxygen is scarce.
  - It is also unknown when silicone-based life was introduced to Earth.
  - But it is known oxygen corrodes their chemistry.
  - And they are your only fuel.
  - Use w-a-s-d to MOVE and double tap to DASH \n Fire MISSILEs with mouse-left \n Mouse-right fires O2 BUBBLEs, detonated with MISSILEs
  startText: {fileID: 1564409957}
  startFill: {fileID: 674621006}
  startButton: {fileID: 674621005}
